Ledger provides the sequence of events showing the defendant’s software using our protected technology without permission.” This analogy underscores reliability and objectivity. Or use a security camera analogy: 
“RBGA’s ledger is like having a CCTV inside the software – it catches any unauthorized entry or action on video (metaphorically). We can replay those events for you step by step.” This helps non-technical legal 
